{number: 81}
{title: Stand Up, Stand Up for Jesus}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] Stand up, stand up for [F] Jesus, ye [C] soldiers [G7] of the [C] cross;
Lift high His royal [F] banner, it [C] must not [G7] suffer [C] loss:
From [G7] vict'ry unto [C] vict'ry His [F] army shall He [G7] lead,
Till [C] every foe is [F] vanquished, and [C] Christ is [G7] Lord in-[C] deed.
